<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Student Study Room</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eaf4ff;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .room {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background: #f7faff;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        ul {
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="room">

    <h1>🧑‍🎓 My Virtual Study Room</h1>

    <p>
        Welcome to my simple virtual study room. This page represents
        the things I need for a productive study session.
    </p>

    <div class="section">

        <h2>📚 Study Materials</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Textbooks</li>
            <li>Notebook</li>
            <li>Class notes</li>
            <li>Practice questions</li>
            <li>Reference materials</li>
        </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="section">

        <h2>💻 Digital Tools</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Laptop</li>
            <li>Code editor</li>
            <li>Web browser</li>
            <li>Online learning platforms</li>
        </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="section">

        <h2>🎯 Study Goals</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Understand today's topic</li>
            <li>Complete practice questions</li>
            <li>Revise previous lessons</li>
            <li>Learn something new</li>
        </ul>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
